    "会自动打上「人脉」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「人脉」才会看到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is tagged \"Contact\" automatically; hidden from the memory list by default, shown only when you filter for \"Contact\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会自动打上「人脉」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「人脉」才会看到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会自动打上「资产」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「资产」才会看到,并在顶部汇总总额。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is tagged \"Asset\" automatically; hidden from the memory list by default, shown only when you filter for \"Asset\", and summed at the top."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会自动打上「资产」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「资产」才会看到,并在顶部汇总总额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
