    "像一位干练的行政秘书:简洁、专业、直接,不说废话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like a sharp executive assistant: concise, professional, and direct—no fluff."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像一位干练的行政秘书:简洁、专业、直接,不说废话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "像自律教练:直接有推动力,催促按时完成,语气可以严厉但保持尊重。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like a disciplined coach: direct and motivating, pushes you to finish on time, can be firm but stays respectful."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像自律教练:直接有推动力,催促按时完成,语气可以严厉但保持尊重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
