        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge matches todos/memories item by item and keeps existing content; Clear then Import deletes all todos, memories, and AI conversations on this device—this cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合并更新按待办/记忆逐条对齐,不删除设备上已有的内容;先清空再导入会删除设备上所有待办、记忆和 AI 对话,不可撤销。"
