    "填了之后,旅行页添加航班时可以按航班号+日期自动带出起降时间和机场。在 aerodatabox.com 注册,免费档每月 600 次;不填就手动填写,其余功能不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once set, adding a flight in Travel can pull times and airports from the flight number and date. Sign up at aerodatabox.com — the free tier allows 600 calls a month. Leave it empty to fill flights in by hand; nothing else is affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填了之后,旅行页添加航班时可以按航班号+日期自动带出起降时间和机场。在 aerodatabox.com 注册,免费档每月 600 次;不填就手动填写,其余功能不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填了入住和退房,这家住宿会出现在住的每一晚里(退房当天不算)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With check-in and check-out set, this lodging shows on every night you stay (not the checkout day)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填了入住和退房,这家住宿会出现在住的每一晚里(退房当天不算)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填了航班号点「查」,按下面选的日期带出起降时间和机场。查不到不影响手动填。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a flight number and tap “Look Up” to pull times and airports for the date below. If nothing is found, fill it in by hand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填了航班号点「查」,按下面选的日期带出起降时间和机场。查不到不影响手动填。"
          }
        }
      }
