    "思考强度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking Level"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "思考强度越高,回答通常越准确但等待更久;只有支持推理的服务商/模型才会真正生效,其余会忽略这个设置,不影响正常使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Higher thinking levels are usually more accurate but slower to respond. This only takes effect with providers/models that support reasoning; others ignore the setting without any impact."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考强度越高,回答通常越准确但等待更久;只有支持推理的服务商/模型才会真正生效,其余会忽略这个设置,不影响正常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "总结/复盘类任务打开「带上今天的待办」;天气、行情这类要开「允许联网搜索」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For summary/review tasks, turn on \"Include today's todos\"; for weather, market data, etc., turn on \"Allow web search\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
